  "totalBlocks": 17,
  "translatedBlocks": 16,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf1222110453c0ad",
      "translationZh": "我折腾 MoE 卸载已经有一阵子了。配置：Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B Q4_K_M（48.5 GB）、RTX 3090，只将 1/4 的专家保留在 VRAM 中，其余专家在路由器请求时从 NVMe 读取。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19b4e7b15ae1541e",
      "translationZh": "当路由器选中的专家不在 VRAM 中时，你可以等待 SSD 读取，也可以使用已经在 GPU 上的次优专家。把所有这类专家都替换掉会严重损害质量（在我的仿真测试中，ppl 增加了 +5.7%）。只等待路由器的首选专家以及门控权重 >= 0.15 的专家，其余则进行替换，就把增幅降到了 +0.35%。在实际引擎中，这条规则带来的代价更接近 +1.2%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61b4e31b352dbf11",
      "translationZh": "在租用的 3090 机器上的解码速度，单位为 tok/s（NVMe ~5.7 GB/s，16 个线程），两者都使用约 15.7 GB 的 VRAM：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0afcf1b0754b71db",
      "translationZh": "| 可用 RAM | 原版 llama.cpp（--n-cpu-moe 34） | 修改版 |",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58efdce6a479a3b1",
      "translationZh": "| 充足 | 72.9 | 108.4 |",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6299294dd4c0ea57",
      "translationZh": "| 约16 GB | 31.8 | 94.5 |",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4eb3cd38f5ffdbed",
      "translationZh": "在 16 GB 时，即使每次未命中都直接从 SSD 读取，它仍能达到 89 tok/s。在相同文本上，困惑度比原版高 1.6%。在 GSM8K（500 道题）上，相比等待每个专家的做法，它低了 1.8 分；在 HumanEval 上则没有实质差异。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a3b367908579da87",
      "translationZh": "尝试之前需要了解的事项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ee21a76d46b32fd1",
      "translationZh": "这是一个研究性补丁，不是完善的分支版本。它会构建一个基准测试工具，我还没有用它测试过 llama-server 或 llama-cli",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b48dafe1b2b81f1",
      "translationZh": "仅支持 Qwen3-Next，仅支持 Linux + CUDA，一次只能处理一个序列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f1794c1387772a1a",
      "translationZh": "16 GB 的情况是在内存更大的机器上通过锁定 RAM 来模拟的",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "508ac6af2876f019",
      "translationZh": "表中列出的是向模型输入真实文本时的解码速度。在实际的贪心生成中，速度为 64-74 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "314970cca679b571",
      "translationZh": "代码、运行脚本和原始日志：https://github.com/SOCIALPINE/moe-miss-substitution",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfc8d6accf1607cf",
      "translationZh": "介绍详细情况的论文，也包括哪些尝试没有奏效：https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-11268552/v1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ff7d4a8bba74af2",
      "translationZh": "有人尝试过类似的方法吗？或者有人有使用更慢 SSD 的测试数据吗？很好奇 SSD 的影响到底有多大。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b5f66b24e6317f0",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Zestyclose_Reality15 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
